PartialFillSettler_fillerRollovers
├── when (orderDigest, filler) has never been filled
│   └── it should return the zero-value FillerRollover struct
├── when (orderDigest, filler) has been filled
│   └── it should return the populated FillerRollover with the recorded fields
└── when (orderDigest, filler) has been finalised or refunded
    └── it should return the populated FillerRollover with the terminal flag set
